.TH AVR\-SKILL\-SHOW 1 "" "avr" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-skill-show \- Print the avr guide for coding agents.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr skill show
[OPTIONS] [TOPIC]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the avr guide for coding agents.
.PP
Without a topic, prints the rules every task follows and the list of topics. With a topic, prints that part of the guide. The guide belongs to the installed avr version.
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
Topics:
  test      Push a change and follow its CI run, or dispatch a workflow
  diagnose  Find why a run failed
  speed     Find why CI is slow, caches and right-sized runners
  vms       On-demand Linux, macOS and Windows VMs
.fi
.RE
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
[\fITOPIC\fR]
(choices: test, diagnose, speed, vms)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-skill (1),
.BR avr-skill-install (1),
.BR avr-skill-uninstall (1)
